ined booking. This means the trip was booked as two separate reservations, not one combined booking. Each has its own reservation number, and both are listed in Dana's reservations.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01MZQhrEWbWGTnkC2apX4jbU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01X1zyuy3ripaUjXiddpu2Bx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_016zQV8NXqbGNYzLaH182wnx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-sfo-jfk-2026-11-12-midtown-lodge-2n"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The booking request timed out, so I'll check whether it went through before retrying.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Udgu8k9gKK4JQvHppF2RZ1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The flight (R0001, F100, $289) is confirmed, but the hotel is not on the reservation list. I'll book only the hotel separately so the flight isn't duplicated.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01RSYL6hUprzzbPVMWSJMHLy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12